{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36435","headline":"赠东川梓桐县韦德孙长官 · 罗邺","name":"赠东川梓桐县韦德孙长官","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"前代高门今宰邑，怀才重义古来无。\n笙歌厌听吟清句，京洛思归展画图。\n蜀酝天寒留容醉，陇禽山晓隔帘呼。\n何年期拜朱幡贵，马上论诗在九衢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36435.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36435","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}